---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
---
<Base title="Careers" description="Hiring opens when construction begins. Be the first to know.">
  <Section eyebrow="Careers" title="We're not hiring yet. Soon, though." narrow>
    <div class="prose-svge">
      <p class="text-lg">
        SVGE will hire its first plant operations, lab, aggregation, and accounts team when construction begins on the Thatipadu site. Right now it's just the two directors and a small set of contractors.
      </p>

      <h2>The roles we plan to open</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Plant operations</strong> — shift engineers, biogas operators, instrumentation technicians.</li>
        <li><strong>Lab</strong> — gas analysis chemists for daily IS 16087:2016 verification.</li>
        <li><strong>Feedstock aggregation</strong> — field supervisors managing farmer relationships and daily collection logistics in a 50&nbsp;km radius.</li>
        <li><strong>Accounts & administration</strong> — payments, GST, statutory compliance.</li>
        <li><strong>Drivers</strong> — for cascade truck operations to IOCL.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we will offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Salaries calibrated to district norms, with on-time monthly payment.</li>
        <li>Statutory PF and ESI from day one of permanent roles.</li>
        <li>Telugu-medium contracts as default; English available on request.</li>
        <li>A short commute. We hire local first.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Be first to know</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:svge.india@gmail.com?subject=Careers%20interest">svge.india@gmail.com</a> with subject line <em>Careers interest</em> and a one-line note about the role you'd be a fit for. We'll add you to a small list and contact you the day a relevant opening is posted.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don't run a formal applicant tracking system yet. Your email goes to a single inbox the directors check personally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Base>
